      "tag": "農業",
      "tone": "insight",
      "title": "智慧農業",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "歐盟正檢討 2009/128/EC 指令對空中施藥的限制，執委會提案簡化特定農用無人機授權，義大利三年期噴灑試驗待政令通過即啟動。",
          "sourceName": "UkrAgroConsult",
          "source": "https://ukragroconsult.com/en/news/eu-prepares-to-ease-rules-on-agricultural-drone-spraying/"
        },
        {
          "text": "11/17 發表，配備 22 加侖藥箱、雙葉輪泵每分鐘最高 15.8 加侖，軟體套件架設於美國本土雲端。",
          "sourceName": "PR Newswire",
          "source": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/agri-spray-drones-introduces-agri-225-bringing-field-experience-to-its-new-agricultural-spray-drone-302942645.html"
        },
        {
          "text": "AgNavigator 10 月十大農業創新回顧（11/04）指出，Soilytix 以 AI 分析土壤 DNA，在昂貴田間試驗前先篩選生物防治候選物。",
          "sourceName": "AgNavigator",
          "source": "https://www.agnavigator.com/Article/2026/11/04/october-recap-top-10-agriculture-innovation-startup-business-and-trend-stories/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "家庭",
      "tone": "intelligence",
      "title": "智慧家庭 / IoT",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "社群整合、儀表板卡片與主題可直接在設定中安裝，不必另裝 HACS；自動化目標也新增「排除」區域／裝置功能。",
          "sourceName": "Home Assistant",
          "source": "https://www.home-assistant.io/blog/2026/11/04/release-202611/"
        },
        {
          "text": "11/12 起推送：智慧螢幕視覺化回答、更快語音控制，並以公開預覽推出數位家門鑰匙，可用 Google 錢包感應開啟相容智慧鎖。",
          "sourceName": "TechBriefly",
          "source": "https://techbriefly.com/2026/11/12/google-rolls-out-major-gemini-for-home-update/"
        },
        {
          "text": "Matter 1.5 攝影機可在 Home Assistant 看即時影像，Reolink 攝影機透過 RTSP 首波支援雙向語音（10/30 報導）。",
          "sourceName": "Matter Alpha",
          "source": "https://www.matteralpha.com/industry-news/matter-cameras-and-two-way-talk-officially-arrive-in-home-assistant-2026-11"
        }
      ]
    },
