      "title": "無人機系統",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "AUVSI 政策研討會上 FAA 表示，自 1 月以來 UTM 已完成 220 萬架次無人機飛行衝突排解；Part 108 BVLOS 規則仍待白宮審查，法定期限為 12/7。",
          "sourceName": "DroneXL",
          "source": "https://dronexl.co/2026/11/10/faa-auvsi-utm-2-2-million-flights-part-108-type-certification/"
        },
        {
          "text": "Skyways 混合動力 V2 無人機獲准由路易斯安那海岸超視距飛往墨西哥灣 Shell 管線平台，執行管線巡檢與模擬物資運送。",
          "sourceName": "AIN Online",
          "source": "https://www.ainonline.com/aviation-news/futureflight/2026-11-12/faa-grants-first-high-seas-bvlos-waiver-skyways"
        },
        {
          "text": "因應 FCC 與美國國防部對外國無人機的限制，Agri Spray 將從經銷中國製農用無人機轉為在美自製，先從軟體與組裝做起。",
          "sourceName": "DroneLife",
          "source": "https://dronelife.com/2026/11/12/agri-spray-plans-shift-to-u-s-drone-manufacturing-as-federal-restrictions-reshape-the-market"
        }
      ]
    },
