        {
          "text": "瓦特納冰川天然冰洞開放（須持證嚮導），高地 F 路依法封閉；建議租四驅車配冬季胎，南岸注意結冰步道與強風（10/28 報導）。",
          "sourceName": "Nomad Lawyer",
          "source": "https://www.nomadlawyer.org/iceland-winter-travel-november-ice-cave-openings-safety-regulations-2026"
        },
        {
          "text": "推薦人氣餐廳 Rok 與 Messinn、哈爾格林姆教堂旁 Braud & Co 肉桂捲，Sky Lagoon 七步驟溫泉儀式，南岸可走到 Seljalandsfoss 瀑布後方。",
          "sourceName": "The Irish Times",
          "source": "https://www.irishtimes.com/life-style/travel/2026/11/02/a-weekend-in-iceland-northern-lights-spectacular-glaciers-buzzy-restaurants-and-lots-of-tourists/"
